-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SURFACE SUMMARY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
selectedVehicle is the web *selected-vehicle store* (React context + localStorage)
composed with useSelectedVehicle() (URL > store > first-vehicle precedence). The
native parity ships, with collision-proof `SelectedVehicleStore*` type names (the
module already defines `SelectedVehicleRef`/`SelectedVehicleFeedPhase` in the
NoVehicleSelected surface):
  selectedVehicle.Adapter.swift   - Foundation-only core: slug, storage key
                                    (teslasync-selected-vehicle), id parser (web
                                    loadInitial/parseId), resolver (precedence +
                                    URL-adoption + first-vehicle-default), render
                                    projection, copy, accessibility.
  selectedVehicle.Seams.swift     - storage seam (UserDefaults / unavailable /
                                    in-memory), fleet source seam (web useVehicles
                                    + URL), telemetry seam (P1/S11 view.opened),
                                    i18n facade (P1/S10).
  selectedVehicle.Store.swift     - @Observable store = web SelectedVehicleProvider
                                    + useSelectedVehicleStore: hydrate, set, clear,
                                    cross-scene sync (UserDefaults.didChange =
                                    web cross-tab `storage` event), .disconnected()
                                    no-op fallback (outside-provider parity).
  selectedVehicle.Model.swift     - @Observable view-model (P1/S8): composes store
                                    + fleet source, resolves phase, write-back
                                    effects, actions, stale auto-refresh, view.opened.
  selectedVehicle.Views.swift     - header, freshness chip, connectivity banner,
                                    selected-vehicle card, empty, loading, error.
  selectedVehicle.swift           - SelectedVehicleStoreView (phase ladder).
  selectedVehicle.Previews.swift  - 8 previews (content/empty/loading/error/stale/
                                    offline/in-session-only/disconnected).
  selectedVehicle.strings         - i18n table "selectedVehicle".
  selectedVehicle.Tests.swift     - adapter/resolver/copy/a11y/store unit tests.
  selectedVehicle.ModelTests.swift- view-model state-holder tests.

States rendered (no hidden surfaces): loading, content (resolved vehicle), empty
(fleet empty / unmatched saved id), error (failed fleet read + retry), stale +
offline (freshness chip + banner), plus the persistence note (persisted /
in-session-only / untracked) reproducing the web localStorage reality.

